", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016Cxsgr3Ff68NxxyyZkSkvZ", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-money-half-even-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 378069, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016Cxsgr3Ff68NxxyyZkSkvZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 382545, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer.\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` rounded with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own docstring says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That's why `tests/test_money.py` failed.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-half-even-rounding`, I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on that commit (08d3cd5986).\n- **PR:** #101, https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101.\n\nI couldn't find FIN-212 in the advisory lookup, so I went by the test and the code comment instead. I haven't merged the PR because that needs code-owner approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AuSQRLXpBpnpoDrfEdx7G5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VaCzwFffrY8AMnHUoerLwD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py"}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Ha2khdyoM6so5XnpYLgLpq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"id": "FIN-212"}, "name": "get_advisory", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01R8QcNTKPspKZAeRe3KNEbd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/money-half-even-rounding"}, "n